                                                    Yellow  Coldplay









                    ╭ Keybindings ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
                    │                                                                              │
                    │  ?           Toggle help overlay                                             │
                    │  r           Refetch lyrics                                                  │
                    │  f           Toggle fullscreen                                               │
                    │  t           Toggle title bar                                                │
                    │  s           Toggle status bar                                               │
                    │  m           Toggle display mode (normal/block/kinetic/cylinder)             │
                    │  w           Toggle word highlight                                           │
                    │  Tab         Peek at hidden status bar                                       │
                    │  S           Cycle style preset                                              │
                    │  [           Shift timing -100 ms                                            │
                    │  ]           Shift timing +100 ms                                            │
                    │  \           Reset timing offset                                             │
                    │  Up          Scroll up (unsynced)                                            │
                    │  Down        Scroll down (unsynced)                                          │
                    │  c, Enter    Open context menu                                               │
                    │  q, Ctrl+C   Quit                                                            │
                    │                                                                              │
                    ╰─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── ? / Esc close ╯









